      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c550cec03c03ef68f1427d79",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿和比赛前一样，\n很担心她是否被幸运\n吞噬而变了个人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2909fec8621f8cd0cbe41b929a0d3d4b773d161be104ae94685a8a0fecb985ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9ea0ec1bfcda0781aaf01a4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听到无声铃鹿的话后，\n待兼福来才猛然回过神来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26fb5d5ffc49c78a9c370bd0c894fca64b81942519341c6031928431f23883a2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3de12780bdc1291a24805858",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她察觉到自己只会依靠运气，\n什么努力都没做，呆站在原地心想，\n这样子真的算是赢得比赛了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ff92c6e7e28d13580a35a9e6a1c0a5a8e27c50d56dbeae6d675db3702d45f51",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
