      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "待兼福来不敢相信\n自己竟然在“金鯱赏”落败。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7b3869aa1c341c9cda5c785d423104dea47f64ef92572d5ba2432f085463b68",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
