    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f9fc3bf06a476a499ca814f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就算告诉她下一个目标是\n“宝冢纪念”，她的哭声\n也没有停止。",
